---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import ResearchIcon from '@/assets/menu-icons/search.svg';


---

<Layout title="Research | Dr. Jenny Power">
  <div class="max-w-none">
  <header class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
  <ResearchIcon class="w-7 h-7 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" />
  <span class="flex-1 text-left text-4xl font-bold">Research</span>
  </header>

    <section class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center lg:items-center gap-8 border-b pb-12">
      <!-- Accent bar -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block w-1 bg-primary rounded-full h-64 "></div>

      <!-- Text content -->
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-4">
        <p class="text-lg text-base-content">
         My research interests lie in <span class="text-accent font-bold">PDE modelling</span> and <span class="text-accent font-bold">numerical analysis</span>. In particular, I am really interested in finite element methods, reaction diffusion equations, singularly perturbed problems, 
         PDE-constrained optimisation, optimal control, inverse problems, and wave phenomena. I am also interested in applications relating to medical physics.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-base-content">
         I am currently working as an Innovation Research Associate at the Mathematics-Driven Innovation Centre (<a href="https://mdice.site.hw.ac.uk/"><span class=" font-bold text-primary ">M-DICE</span></a>) at Heriot Watt University. My work focuses on interdisciplinary research, applying advanced mathematical methods and research to problems from industry. Recently, I have been working on problems in Mixed-Integer Linear Programming and Mathematical Biology.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- PhD Research -->
    <!-- <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 mt-6">PhD Research</h2>
    <div class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-lg mb-4"></p>
    </div> -->




  
</Layout>
